  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>If you wish to pull information from Odoo on payments done and show them in Clinical screens, you can look at his discussion: <a href=\"https://talk.openmrs.org/t/handling-pay-before-services-in-openmrs-and-bahmni/22421\">https://talk.openmrs.org/t/handling-pay-before-services-in-openmrs-and-bahmni/22421</a>. MekomSolutions have published on OpenMRS module for communicating and pulling this information from Odoo. </p><p>Please post your questions about this module in Bahmni/OpenMRS Talk. </p><p>It can potentially look like this: </p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"283\" ac:original-width=\"517\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20210210-114320.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p />",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
        "content": "/rest/api/content/2136473610"
      }
    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<p>If you wish to pull information from Odoo on payments done and show them in Clinical screens, you can look at his discussion: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://talk.openmrs.org/t/handling-pay-before-services-in-openmrs-and-bahmni/22421\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://talk.openmrs.org/t/handling-pay-before-services-in-openmrs-and-bahmni/22421</a>. MekomSolutions have published on OpenMRS module for communicating and pulling this information from Odoo. </p><p>Please post your questions about this module in Bahmni/OpenMRS Talk. </p><p>It can potentially look like this: </p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2136473610/image-20210210-114320.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1612957402883&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2136473610/image-20210210-114320.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1612957402883&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"283\" data-width=\"517\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2138079245\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20210210-114320.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"2136473610\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"1\" data-media-id=\"a0eb49d3-e844-4157-b7a7-a9df47a59bce\" data-media-type=\"file\"></span><p />",
